          "headline": "Severe Thunderstorm Watch issued September 6 at 11:27PM MDT until September 7 at 1:00AM MDT by NWS Great Falls MT",
          "description": "SEVERE THUNDERSTORM WATCH 662 REMAINS VALID UNTIL 1 AM MDT MONDAY\nFOR THE FOLLOWING AREAS\n\nIN MONTANA THIS WATCH INCLUDES 2 COUNTIES\n\nIN CENTRAL MONTANA\n\nFERGUS\n\nIN NORTH CENTRAL MONTANA\n\nBLAINE\n\nTHIS INCLUDES THE CITIES OF CHINOOK, GRASS RANGE, HARLEM, HAYS,\nLEWISTOWN, LEWISTOWN DIVIDE, AND WINIFRED.",
          "effective": "2026-09-06T23:27:00-06:00",
