          "expires": "2026-09-07T09:30:00-04:00",
          "headline": "Small Craft Advisory issued September 7 at 1:25AM EDT until September 7 at 10:00PM EDT by NWS Wakefield VA",
          "description": "* WHAT...Northeast winds 5 to 15 kt and seas 3 to 5 ft.\n\n* WHERE...Coastal Waters from Cape Charles Light to Virginia-\nNorth Carolina border out 20 NM and Coastal waters from NC VA\nborder to Currituck Beach Light NC out 20 NM.\n\n* WHEN...Until 10 PM EDT this evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.",
          "instruction": "Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller\nvessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.",
          "effective": "2026-09-07T01:25:00-04:00",
          "onset": "2026-09-07T01:25:00-04:00",
