          "expires": "2026-09-06T23:45:00-06:00",
          "headline": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 6 at 11:17PM MDT until September 6 at 11:45PM MDT by NWS Glasgow MT",
          "description": "At 1116 PM MDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 7 miles southwest\nof Zortman, moving northeast at 30 mph.\n\nHAZARD...Golf ball size hail.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...People and animals outdoors will be injured. Expect damage\nto roofs, siding, windows, and vehicles.\n\nLocations impacted include...\nZortman, Phillips, Landusky, and Fred Robinson Bridge.",
          "instruction": "For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a\nbuilding.\n\nTorrential rainfall is occurring with this storm, and may lead to\nflash flooding. Do not drive your vehicle through flooded roadways.",
          "effective": "2026-09-06T23:17:00-06:00",
          "onset": "2026-09-06T23:17:00-06:00",
          "senderName": "NWS Glasgow MT",
          "responseType": [
